# Hard Fourier-analysis statements from Grafakos

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from Loukas Grafakos,
*Classical Fourier Analysis*, third edition.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/GrafakosFourier/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/GrafakosFourier/Defs.lean`.
-/
